[I] C library for lightweight websocket clients and servers

[T] libwebsockets is a lightweight, MIT licensed pure C library providing
[T] clients and servers for HTTP/1, HTTP/2, HTTP/3, websockets, MQTT and
[T] other protocols. It is security-minded and scalable, suitable from
[T] embedded RTOS to mass cloud serving.

[U] https://libwebsockets.org/

[A] Libwebsockets Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base
[F] CROSS

[V] 5.1.0
[L] MIT

[D] 5c086a18ba4ae6c758cf5c5aede20de50776e8b86452ef0812e19dfe libwebsockets-5.1.0.tar.gz https://github.com/warmcat/libwebsockets/archive/v5.1.0/

pkginstalled libuv && var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DLWS_WITH_LIBUV=ON

var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DLWS_WITH_MINIMAL_EXAMPLES=OFF
var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DLWS_WITH_HTTP3=OFF
